        <p class="h2" style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #0071c5; line-height: 19px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;"><span class="eloquaemail"></span></p>
        <p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">
        This notice is to inform you that your order request for Intel® FPGA Software/IP licenses has been completed<br></br>
        </p>     
        <p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">
        <b>Below are your Order details: </b><br></br>
        <b>Order Number: {!relatedTo.OrderNumber} </b><br></br>
        </p>
          <c:Sales_OrderConfirmationEmail orderId="{!relatedTo.Id}"/>
        <p></p>
        <br></br>
        <p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">To get started with managing your licenses, please login to <apex:outputLink value="{!$Label.Sales_SSLC_URL}"> Intel® FPGA Self-service licensing center</apex:outputLink> using your myIntel account. 
        <br></br>
        <br></br>
        Sincerely,<br></br>
        Intel Corporation <br></br>
        Programmable Solutions Group</p>       
        </th>
